      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: For example, if a nuisance user is harassing other users, such as verbally abusing them or making noise from their avatar, we will not be able to observe it.\nIn an event with 10 to 20 participants, it may be difficult to explain what happened to Visitor or New Users, or they may suffer from lack of understanding of the situation. In order to avoid such situations, I feel it is necessary to use moderator kick effectively.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
