  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-23T17:16:19.509Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want to display a badge on the player's nameplate that only I can see, such as \"star\" or \"thumbs down\" in its default state.\nThis is necessary to avoid \"being an annoying user but blocking him makes his actions invisible\" when proceeding with an event, and you should make it visible only to yourself that the player may be nuisance in some way.",
